  "title": "Pickled Grilled Red Onions",
  "description": "These onions are sweet and tart. They are terrific as a condiment for a piece of grilled chicken or on top of your best burger.",
  "authors": [
    "CookBrooke"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:25:59-04:00",
